REACTION   (26-FE-56(N,EL)26-FE-56,,DA)
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) Propagated from uncertainties due to
            - statistics,
            - Monte-Carlo model for the detector response
               modelling,
            - beam monitoring with the fission (common for all
               detectors)
HISTORY    (20260331A) On. ERR-ANALYS moved from 001.
